            },
            "reviewBody": "I used coffee ice cubes (that I make with leftover coffee) and a frozen banana. I only used 1/2 c crushed ice. I liked this. I couldn't taste the coffee much, but it was creamy, icy and good. *Update- I made this again today and used caramel syrup instead of chocolate, and it was good.",
