            },
            "reviewBody": "This was.....interesting.\n\nI used frozen yogurt to lighten it up, \nbut kept everything else the same. I keep a pitcher of cold coffee in the fridge during summer so it makes it easier when making drinks like this.\n\nIt was great to not only use the excess \nfrozen bananas I have in the fridge but\nit also adds more fiber/fruit in my day.\n\nI'm just not sure I like it.",
